  _cardName: Assistente Municipal por IA
  _description: "Um assistente de intelig\xEAncia artificial responde d\xFAvida de
    morador a qualquer hora, sem fila nem protocolo. Tecnologia real: o chatbot MyCity,
    de Nova York \u2014 caso real e documentado de a IA errar orienta\xE7\xE3o legal
    pra pequenos empres\xE1rios, lembrando que automatizar atendimento tem risco."
  _cardNameEn: AI Municipal Assistant
  _descriptionEn: "An AI assistant answers residents' questions any time of day,
    no lines or paperwork. Real technology: New York's MyCity chatbot \u2014 a real,
    documented case of the AI giving wrong legal guidance to small business owners,
    a reminder that automating service delivery carries risk."
